{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3001_p", "source_sha256": "17c99422b20cacf34e280fff1855a3a84c92c2df4b15a61629c6762f5db102e6", "ja": "あずささん。番組収録、お疲れさまでした。\n憧れの占い師さんとのお話は、どうでしたか？", "zh": "梓小姐，节目录影辛苦了。\n和景仰的占卜师谈话，感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3002_010azu", "source_sha256": "0e1314ca7f89b6c099b915d198746bcd6142a539961cab5ac7d7c4fa12dc4628", "ja": "はい、とっても優しい方でした。\nでも……。", "zh": "是的，对方是个非常温柔的人。\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3003_010azu", "source_sha256": "82608a6b130d20e7c3d6ecab7ead26e43458c7bb00aaf43761f5efa4467377b7", "ja": "私……今年の結婚運は、最悪なんだそうです。\n{$P$}さん、どうしましょう～！？", "zh": "我……今年的结婚运好像很糟。\n{$P$}先生，我要怎么办～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3004_p", "source_sha256": "b2ea55ce031d2e5ce5cf716fe39f911fbc39e1d1fcb525d45e4d640c7c97974a", "ja": "え！　それは、その……。", "zh": "咦！就是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3005", "source_sha256": "262e46c84390ab439a52593e18134f124c8659221c27ad19f104e93aa32d90ff", "ja": "ポジティブに\n考えましょう", "zh": "乐观\n看待", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3006", "source_sha256": "4254b8a62eda2e48b63b46070c0e331802e47194ec248fb4a64732100249a46e", "ja": "気にすること\nないですよ", "zh": "不需要\n在意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3200_p", "source_sha256": "2dcc8be4199e5838240cac2b5f1bcff3bd9f42121e722a20c752104777ec37c1", "ja": "結果を、ポジティブにとらえましょう！\n受け取り方ひとつで、気持ちも変わりますよ！", "zh": "乐观看待结果吧！\n换个角度看事情，心情也会不一样喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3201_010azu", "source_sha256": "ae7d9a76744ca142969b55f3f457f70531db34145f19c6233d6c7db7250d9faf", "ja": "そうですね。それに、運命の人が見つかったら、\nアイドル活動も終わりになってしまいますものね。", "zh": "说得也是。而且，如果遇到真命天子了，\n偶像活动也要跟着结束了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3202_010azu", "source_sha256": "6883e3a58a327a4012ed365c8a61159dd46787d1aca99e23a0b347ec5e6e257f", "ja": "私、結婚は、もう少しお預けにして……\n今はアイドルを頑張りますね。", "zh": "结婚的事情再稍微往后延……\n我现在会先努力当个偶像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3203_010azu", "source_sha256": "29401b1ba9b24a898a696238a45676179ab7c50181859375080d4b3e82452a97", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nよろしくお願いしますね。うふふ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请多指教啰，唔呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3300_p", "source_sha256": "2dcc8be4199e5838240cac2b5f1bcff3bd9f42121e722a20c752104777ec37c1", "ja": "結果を、ポジティブにとらえましょう！\n受け取り方ひとつで、気持ちも変わりますよ！", "zh": "乐观看待结果吧！\n换个角度看事情，心情也会不一样喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3301_010azu", "source_sha256": "e27074051cdb2e95a6c0dd33b4c37be3ca2f1fc101d51120b1e6893cd91b4bf3", "ja": "そうは言っても、気になってしまうんです～。", "zh": "就算你这么说，我还是会在意呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3302_010azu", "source_sha256": "3c28bc418c3ef3d56d6dd6f89631e5100fa4ad62d1389b4df0bb9cdf9db4fc83", "ja": "運命の人、意外と近くにいるのかも、と思っていたん\nですけど……まだまだ、遠いみたいですね……。", "zh": "我本来还想，真命天子说不定就意外地近在眼前，\n只是……看来对方还离我很远的样子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3500_p", "source_sha256": "acea0ea55cb9d90b700fcec56837cf5fa2f338d7cb2fe90806872d917986ef02", "ja": "気にすることありませんよ。どんな占いだって、\n必ず当たるとは限らないんですから。", "zh": "你不需要在意，无论是什么占卜，\n都不见得一定就算得准啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3501_010azu", "source_sha256": "4d8f1a0b191267ca2f4db9aa8914b9f7292cc167c504fb0812c91cb07afcf3f5", "ja": "そうですね……。昔から、\n当たるも八卦、当たらぬも八卦といいますし……。", "zh": "说得也是……从前就有人说过，\n卜卦有时灵，有时不灵，不必太介意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3502_010azu", "source_sha256": "14523e4ba134c954d7ea8f868acbbf4fcc3621a2e7bc7b7b8698b1098f9a995c", "ja": "わかりました。憧れの占い師さんですけど……\n今回は、あまり気にしないことにしますね。", "zh": "我知道了，虽然对方是我景仰的占卜师……\n但这次我会尽量不去在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3503_010azu", "source_sha256": "25fe186b89525d339131253318c1b7d6631b0f3b29a805b6c5864f124681c6cb", "ja": "なんだか、少しだけ気持ちが軽くなりました。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "总觉得心情轻松一点了。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3600_p", "source_sha256": "acea0ea55cb9d90b700fcec56837cf5fa2f338d7cb2fe90806872d917986ef02", "ja": "気にすることありませんよ。どんな占いだって、\n必ず当たるとは限らないんですから。", "zh": "你不需要在意，无论是什么占卜，\n都不见得一定就算得准啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3601_010azu", "source_sha256": "56c1e6e0d1d1bd4bbcc64cc2cf985a1bcaf204ba556e66d640cba59e8c9e787c", "ja": "まぁ、{$P$}さん、そんなこと\nありませんよ。占いって、結構当たるんですから。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生，那种事\n可不一定喔。占卜可是相当准的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_010azu_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_010azu_3602_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6390472e67a3df1155ce55414e0eb7972389c1c3c78016e8b2b9befdc98a917", "ja": "なんだかショックです……。\nやっぱり、今年は難しいのかしら……はぁ。", "zh": "总觉得好受打击……\n果然今年很困难吧……唉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
